<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Pilihan Video</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #2563eb);
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 450px;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    p {
      color: #6b7280;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .video-a {
      background: #2563eb;
    }

    .video-b {
      background: #16a34a;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <h1>🎬 Pilih Video</h1>

    <p>Silakan pilih versi video yang ingin ditonton.</p>

    <a
      class="button video-a"
      href="https://youtu.be/h5PHYK0a1fm5cG7EV"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      ▶️ Opsi A
    </a>

    <a
      class="button video-b"
      href="https://youtu.be/vkA3HbEGmho9dHBOe"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      ▶️ Opsi B
    </a>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
